# FitTrack environment variables (all optional).
#
# Exercise media is resolved at runtime from a free source with a clean
# placeholder fallback, so the app runs with no configuration. To enable
# looping demonstration GIFs from ExerciseDB (RapidAPI), provide a key:
#
#   1. Subscribe to ExerciseDB at https://rapidapi.com/justin-WFnsXH_t6/api/exercisedb
#   2. Copy this file to `.env` and set the key below.
#
# Without a key, FitTrack falls back to keyless wger static images, and to a
# clean placeholder when no media is available (offline or no match).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined into the app at build time by Expo.

EXPO_PUBLIC_EXERCISEDB_API_KEY=
EXPO_PUBLIC_EXERCISEDB_HOST=exercisedb.p.rapidapi.com
